1
00:00:00,773 --> 00:00:01,853
(Penny:)Thank you.

2
00:00:02,441 --> 00:00:05,441
(Penny:)Oh, here's my list for you. Right there.

3
00:00:12,326 --> 00:00:14,246
(Leonard:)All right, fair enough.

4
00:00:15,454 --> 00:00:18,704
(Leonard:)I certainly can be quieter
when we kiss.

5
00:00:19,458 --> 00:00:21,208
(Leonard:)It was an expression of passion...

6
00:00:21,377 --> 00:00:25,467
(Leonard:)...but if it's coming across
as "juicy and weird," who wants that?

7
00:00:28,968 --> 00:00:30,218
It... It...

8
00:00:30,386 --> 00:00:35,636
(Leonard:)I'm sorry, can you be more specific
on how my eyebrows are "stupid"?

9
00:00:38,728 --> 00:00:41,318
No, never mind. It's right here.

10
00:00:44,650 --> 00:00:47,440
- Good timing. Dinner's almost ready.
- Great.

11
00:00:47,612 --> 00:00:49,942
(Bernadette:)Oh, smells amazing in here.

12
00:00:50,114 --> 00:00:52,574
- Yeah, what are we eating?
- An exotic little treat.

13
00:00:52,742 --> 00:00:54,992
(Raj:)I was just talking to Siri
about Peking duck...

14
00:00:55,161 --> 00:00:57,621
(Raj:)...she said she knew
about four Chinese grocers...

